	(text "DRV8412 NOTES (per axis)\n- Mode: Parallel full bridge, CBC current limit (M3=0, M2=1, M1=0)\n- PWM_A = D (coil +), PWM_B = 1-D (coil -), unipolar, 20 kHz\n- PWM_C, PWM_D tied to GND (unused in parallel mode)\n- R_OC = 36k -> ~7.4 A per half-bridge (+/-20%)\n- ~{FAULT}, ~{OTW}: internal 26k pull-up to 3.3 V, no external pull-up needed\n- ~{RESET_AB} + ~{RESET_CD} tied together, 10k pull-down to GND\n\nRESET USE (low = all outputs off)\n- Power-up:  hold low until 12 V stable + 5 ms, start PWM at 50%, then high\n- Power-down: set low before removing power\n- OT shutdown: wait >= 1 s, then pulse low -> high to clear\n- Normal stop: ramp current to 0 (50% duty), wait 25 ms, THEN set low\n- Emergency only: set low directly (coil energy returns to PVDD)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.494 165.608 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4f29a255-76af-4abe-bf19-3d5858ae5b5a")
	)
	(text "Solder Jumper so 24V to 12V \nBuck can be tested without \naffecting IC\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.466 54.356 0)
		(effects
